<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Monday's match:</p>
<p>24 - Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>21 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>18 - Robbie Fowler (Liverpool)</p>
<p>17 - Dwight Yorke (Aston Villa), Ole Gunnar Solksjaer</p>
<p>(Manchester United)</p>
<p>16 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough), Mike Evans</p>
<p>(Southampton)</p>
<p>14 - Les Ferdinand (Newcastle)</p>
<p>13 - Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton)</p>
<p>12 - Stan Collymore (Liverpool)</p>
<p>11 - Steve Claridge (Leicester), Dean Sturridge (Derby),</p>
<p>Dennis Bergkamp (Arsenal), Juninho (Middlesbrough)</p>
